The gem must be either named or identified and it must not be a
worthless piece of glass. Then your luck is increased.

> So now I have a
> unicorn horn (and my gem back ofcourse), what should I use that for?
Cure illnesses (confusion, hallucination, sickness, blindness..)
 
> Can I use gems for anything other than chugging at unicorns?
